  "summary": "Recover the CC-021 parameter authorization prospectively.",
  "why": "The operator selected the RET-010 fixture bundle before provisional bytes were written, but the formal CC-021 card authorized only ontology and domain source bytes. This forward-only revision names the two declarative parameter roles without rewriting OVR-000214 or granting the provisional commit candidate authority. It preserves all ownership, dependency, scope, state, selection, worker-ledger, and product boundaries."
